  "application_type": "Householder",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposal, by reason of its depth and height along the western property boundary, forms an overbearing form of development on the neighbouring site at No. 25 Wimborne Drive, resulting in detrimental dominance and enclosure effects. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the London Borough of Harrow&#39;s Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&nbsp;",
    "The proposal, by reason of its excessive height, depth and width forms an incongruous addition to the host property, overwhelming the architectural integrity of the dwellinghouse and encloses the open space between neighbouring dwellings causing detrimental harm to streetscape amenity. The proposal is therefore contrary to Paragraph 131 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the London Borough of Harrow&#39;s Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010).&nbsp;"
  ],
